        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's not here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mein Herr stepped out a while ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursula"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He left?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's off to the hospital just outside the Afterglow, to talk treatment for the Infected who got poisoned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursula"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_doorknob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this, Mein Herr? The hospital\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursula"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I managed to twist the arms of the largest two and got them to sign contracts, but as for the rest... there's no hope.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Rhodes Island signed an agreement with those hospitals!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I didn't notice you were here as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no point. Rhodes Island's contracts are limited to symptoms caused by Oripathy itself. They have ample grounds to not treat Infected patients who've fallen ill from poisoning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Mein Herr, you got those two hospitals. That should be enough, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursula"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. Enough? Of course it's enough! I put every copyright I hold down as collateral, of course the consortium behind them thinks that's enough!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't tell me you\u2013 You transferred all your copyrights over to that consortium?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I did. Not just the existing copyrights. I even sold the distribution rights for tomorrow's concert to them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, I can start from scratch... *cough*, *cough*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*... *cough*!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
