    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're awake?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Urgh... Mhm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Czerny, you didn't take any precautionary measures when you went out, did you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're talking about the fumes from those Originium slugs? I didn't waste a single second getting those contracts signed. That's all that mattered to me when I left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Promise me you'll never be that reckless ever again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "'Ever again?' Are you saying, I still have time left to live?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why I'm here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. You never want to see a doctor until your body gives out on you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Hibiscus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just doing my job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That reminds me, why haven't you said anything, Ebenholz? Are you thinking of throwing in the towel now that the Afterglow is too dangerous?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll tell you straight\u2013 now that we've come this far, the concert MUST go on. Don't even think about running.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't even think about running, huh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whispers) Do you think he'd accept it now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whispers) Give it a moment...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems like you're not here to tell me you're quitting the concert?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I'm not here to tell you I'm quitting the concert.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ebenholz, you repeat what others say when you get nervous. I've noticed it from the very beginning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you have something to say, just spit it out. You think there's anything I wouldn't be able to accept in the state I'm in now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
