    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_glass_break",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*, *cough* *cough*... Damn\u2013\u2013 damn that Gertrude!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And you! How could you possibly go along with a plan like that? Curse me for thinking you had some creative talent, and this is what you use it for? Some evil plot?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't my intention\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How could it not be? Haven't you answered to that crazy woman from the very beginning?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Czerny, I still remember what you said. Even deeply-rooted hatred can still be pure music as long as it is expressed with the right technique.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I did say that, but what comes next? What are you trying to express?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be honest, I'm already starting to find my old way of thinking quite laughable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what I wish to pursue... is nothing more than freedom.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2013\u2013Freedom. A longing for freedom, is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You've got a long way to go before you can express that using music!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "This has long been a deeply-rooted experience for me. Otherwise, I would not have come to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Come now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are we going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where else? The concert hall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gertrude managed to keep me out of the lounge with her little tricks last time, but we're going to get to the bottom of this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But, your health...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Instead of sitting here popping blood vessels over him and that woman, I might as well go see what they're up to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
