    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ebenholz, did Gertrude ever tell you if she did anything to the lounge?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "She didn't say anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She doesn't have to say anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can already tell?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her fingerprints are all over this place...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "See that speaker right there? It shows obvious signs of having been dismantled. The same goes for the record player over there. She didn't even bother to tighten the screws\u2013\u2013 Tsk, even the screwdriver's been left out in the open.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just the kind of handiwork I'd expect from a noble. Hilarious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hibiscus, bring that record player over. Let's see what else has been tampered with besides the tonearm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
