        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Doesn't seem like anything unusual is happening?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't hear anything out of the ordinary either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go over and tell Ebenholz to apply a little bit of Arts... Only the simplest kind to disperse drowsiness, maintained strictly at the lowest level.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
